  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$R_{e q}=\\frac{r}{2}$\n$I=\\frac{2 E}{r+2 R}$\nFor max. power consumption. I should be max. So denominator should be min. for that\n$r+2 R=(\\sqrt{r}, \\quad)$",
